### PhoneMail mail service: try it from GoLand (click the green ▶ next to each request).
### Load test users first:  docker compose exec -T db psql -U phonemail -d phonemail < mailsvc/scripts/seed.sql
### Users: 1 Kavya (9876500001, alias kavya), 2 Asha (9876500002), 3 Ravi (9876500003), 4 Meena (9876500004)

@base = http://localhost:8081
@token = change-me-dev-token

### Health
GET {{base}}/health

### Kavya -> Asha, Cc Ravi (each lands in its own direct chat)
POST {{base}}/messages
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": {"address": "9876500002@phonemail.com"}, "cc": [{"address": "9876500003"}],
 "subject": "Hello", "body_text": "First mail!"}

### Asha's Home (filter: all | unread | attachments | favorites)
GET {{base}}/conversations?filter=all
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 2

### Open a chat (marks it read). Use a conversation_id from Home.
GET {{base}}/conversations/1/messages
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 2

### Asha replies to message 1 in chat 1 (only once!)
POST {{base}}/messages/1/reply
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversation_id": 1, "body_text": "Hi Kavya!"}

### Create a group (compose with Gcc): Kavya becomes admin
POST {{base}}/groups
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Buildathon", "members": [{"address": "9876500002"}, {"address": "9876500003"}]}

### Send to the group (use its conversation_id)
POST {{base}}/messages
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": {"group_id": 3}, "subject": "Standup", "body_text": "Who's doing the Go service?"}

### Two or more people in To start a new group; "group_name" is required
POST {{base}}/messages
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": [{"address": "9876500002"}, {"address": "9876500004"}], "group_name": "Lunch club", "subject": "Lunch?", "body_text": "Friday?"}

### Send into an existing group by its name (To, Cc or Bcc)
POST {{base}}/messages
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"to": {"group": "lunch club"}, "body_text": "Same time next week?"}

### Admin adds Meena: she won't see threads started before now
POST {{base}}/groups/3/members
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"members": [{"address": "9876500004"}]}

### A whole thread in order (rootId = the first message of the thread)
GET {{base}}/threads/3?conversation_id=3
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1

### Favourite a message (or {"folder": "trash"}, {"is_read": false})
PATCH {{base}}/mailbox/1
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{"conversation_id": 1, "is_favourite": true}

### Search messages, a person by number, groups by name
GET {{base}}/search?q=standup
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1

### Save a draft
POST {{base}}/drafts
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipients": {"to": {"address": "9876500004"}}, "subject": "Later", "body_text": "Draft text"}

### Send it
POST {{base}}/drafts/1/send
X-Internal-Token: {{token}}
X-User-ID: 1
